<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada overnight money market financing.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada overnight money market financing.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada's average overnight money market financing rate for the week ended August 13 was 3.27 percent, the Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>(Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
